# Build artifacts and big derivable dumps -- the canonical snapshots/ and
# reports/ ARE checked in, so that switching B200 nodes (or losing /raid)
# doesn't lose the baseline data.
build_*/
sass/
sass_flat/

# Raw PTXAS logs are ~400 KB each and can be regenerated from `ninja
# cub.bench.topk.pairs.base` with `-Xptxas=-v`, but they're also tiny
# enough that we keep them in-tree as the evidence behind each snapshot.
# (Uncomment the next line to drop them from history if a tree gets large.)
# raw_logs/
